00:06:18.352 --> 00:06:19.310
MAYA KACZOROWSKI: Yeah.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.140
I think we're really
fortunate in security.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:22.765
Everyone who's involved
in [? CIGOFF ?]

00:06:22.765 --> 00:06:25.550
